  "description": "Nalix.SDK provides the client-side development kit for the Nalix ecosystem,\noffering high-level APIs, controller abstractions, time synchronization helpers,\nand localization (L10N) utilities for building distributed applications.\n\nIt acts as the bridge between application logic and the Nalix.Network layer,\nsimplifying remote communication, configuration, and message orchestration\nthrough clean, extensible, and developer-friendly interfaces.",
  "iconFile": "assets\\Nalix.png",
