  "releaseNotes": "- Introduced Controller and DirectiveController for structured client-side orchestration.\n\t\t\t- Added Remote module with configurable reliable and unreliable communication clients.\n\t\t\t- Implemented TimeSyncExtensions for clock alignment between client and server.\n\t\t\t- Added L10N subsystem with Localization, Localizer, and MultiLocalizer support.\n\t\t\t- Improved configuration and extension APIs for SDK customization.\n\t\t\t- Enhanced dependency structure for modular SDK integration.\n\t\t\t- General cleanup, documentation updates, and performance tuning.",
